              "heading": "ZX Bank Agriculture Loan"
            },
            "text": "ZX Bank offers specialized Agriculture Loans to empower farmers and agribusinesses across South Asia. Designed to support crop production, equipment purchase, irrigation solutions, dairy, and allied activities, our Agriculture Loan aims to fuel rural prosperity with flexible terms and low interest rates."
          }
